    "1. Add files   2. Pick an output format   3. Convert, then Save as…" : {

    },
    "1. Cases → New case: record how it came in and pick the kind of investigation. 2. Triage it: rate it and accept, decline or refer. 3. Work the plan and the tasks; add sources and register exhibits. 4. Hold the interviews and record statements. 5. Link evidence to each allegation, then record your finding and why. 6. Close the case with your reasons. The app organises, finds and documents — the decisions are yours." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the steps of the investigation process.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
