    },
    "Estimated wall-clock time for 100 MB of a single file type, in each system mode. Scanned PDFs and images cost far more (OCR). Audio/video is catalogued at ingest, not transcribed — on-demand transcription in Transcripts is a separate, later cost." : {

    },
    "EV-005. Default OFF (**reference mode**): Investigations Made Easy keeps a bookmark + hash + the derived evidence, and your files stay where they are — but if a file is later moved or replaced, its exact original bytes may no longer reopen. Turn ON (**managed mode**) to also keep a local, read-only, content-addressed copy of each ingested file, so every version can always be reopened byte-for-byte — recommended for investigations and legal matters. Costs disk (identical files are stored once). Applies to newly-ingested files." : {

